🔹 1. 350‑Character Description
Layer1a‑Smart‑Contracts is the programmable execution layer of CosmaChain. It defines identity‑bound transactions, benefits agreements, revenue splits, booking logic, economic scoring, and domain‑specific contracts for CosmaCare, CosmaStar, CosmaGigs, FilmCore, CaddiePro, and CosmaSocial. All logic runs through a Rust‑based VM, dispatcher, and unified contract engine.

🎯 2. Purpose
Layer1a provides the on‑chain logic that powers the entire CosmaTech ecosystem.

It exists to:

🧠 Execute smart‑contract logic through a Rust‑based VM

📜 Define domain‑specific contracts for every Layer‑4 app

🔐 Enforce identity‑bound transactions (CosmaID)

💰 Power benefits, payouts, revenue splits, and settlement

📊 Anchor S3E2C3 + ESEC scoring into the chain

🔗 Connect Layer‑1 execution to Layer‑2 protocols

🚀 Provide a unified contract interface for Layer‑3 SDK + API Gateway

Layer1a is the programmable heart of CosmaTech.

⚙️ 3. Functions
🧱 Core Engine Functions
Contract VM execution

Contract dispatching

ABI parsing

Contract state management

Event emission

Identity‑bound transaction enforcement

🧩 Domain Contract Functions
Benefits agreements

Revenue splits

Booking logic (CosmaCare)

Service definitions (CosmaStar, CosmaGigs, FilmCore, CaddiePro)

Settlement logic

Social graph interactions (CosmaSocial)

📡 Protocol Functions
S3E2C3 behavioral scoring

ESEC economic scoring

Taxable event detection

Treasury routing

Token mint/burn logic (via Layer‑2 tokens)

